# nr-exthost-syntax-native wiring

1. native/core/crates/mixdog-app-server-daemon/src/exec.rs, fn build_exec, field script_syntax:
   replace  `script_syntax: Arc::new(ExtSyntax::new(hosts.ext_pool)),`
   with     `script_syntax: Arc::new(ExtSyntax::new()),`
   (ExecHosts keeps ext_pool for its other users; if `hosts.ext_pool` is then unused in build_exec, no other change.)

2. native/core/Cargo.lock: package "mixdog-tools" dependencies gain "mixdog-jssyntax" (sorted after "mixdog-js").
   mixdog-tools/Cargo.toml already carries `mixdog-jssyntax = { workspace = true }` (workspace dependency exists).

3. SERVICE_PENDING: nothing to remove.
